 "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc662"}, {"id": "3f7976", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc663"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc664", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df89"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b478f"], "concepts": ["60e2fb1f66f9ce3f243b4b46"], "question": {"text": "The solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CdSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> in water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Its solubility in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;solution is ___&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(Round off to the Nearest integer) (Assume that&nbsp;solubility is much less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> )"}, "options": [{"id": "da440a", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc665"}, {"id": "923b3b", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc666"}, {"id": "cf3705", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc667"}, {"id": "a4507d", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc668"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f01c677dc36a88fc669", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60